     "head": "Jaspreet and Gulnaz are organising a langar (a community lunch) in their neighbourhood Gurudwara. They expect around one thousand (1000) people to be fed on that day. Fifty-five people volunteer to serve during this event. Jaspreet and Gulnaz receive many donations. The donations are shown in the table below. Write the number in each case. Thousands Thousands Around UsAround Us Donations Quantity Number 4 Ones + 7 Tens 100 – 7 Chapter 4 Note for Teachers: Support children in revising the different representations for 2- and 3-digit numbers through such tasks. Chapter 4.indd 39Chapter 4.indd 39 2/11/2026 4:53:45 PM2/11/2026 4:53:45 PM Reprint 2026-27"
